WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.667
-Guys, finally, it is Tuesday.
It is time for "WeTweet."

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:04.734
Here we go.

00:00:04.734 --> 00:00:08.601
