00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:12.934
-Welcome to "WeTweet."

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:14.467
This is where we, as a group,

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:17.334
decide something
that we should post on Twitter.

00:00:17.334 --> 00:00:19.267
I'm gonna show you
five different tweets.

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:21.467
We're all gonna vote on whether
you like each one or not.

00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:23.300
You have all voting clickers
at your seats.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.667
There you go, yeah.
That looks organized.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:29.000
Now, look, you could
vote for all of them,

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.701
you can vote for none of them,
whatever you want.

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:32.601
And we're gonna see
the results live.

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:34.801
Roots, you have your clickers?
-I got it.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:35.934
-Tariq, you have your clicker?

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:37.267
-Yeah, I just entered
all my answers.

00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:38.667
-No, no, no, no.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:41.868
You have to wait for the tweets,
then you vote "yes" or "no."

00:00:41.868 --> 00:00:43.467
The green or red --
thumbs up or thumbs down.

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:45.133
-Okay, got it.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:46.133
You're pretty good
at this, though.

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:47.667
You've -- You're pretty good.

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:49.100
The last two
you've gotten, right?

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.300
-The last two,
I've been super on point, yeah.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.501
-Yeah, alright, here we go.

00:00:51.501 --> 00:00:53.601
Alright, so,
whatever tweet gets most likes,

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:55.634
we're gonna tweet it out live

00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:59.567
yeah, so that you can all
like it and WeTweet it.

00:00:59.567 --> 00:01:02.033
-Aha!
-It's a shared experience.

00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:03.534
Alright, are you guys
ready to do this?

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:05.767
